docs {
  # AssessmentService.Submit

  The teacher sends the sheet to coordinación (or takes it back); assignment_id empty: the tutor's sheet

  `/ltedu.assessment.v1.AssessmentService/Submit` · unary · `ltedu/assessment/v1/assessment.proto`

  ## Request — `SubmitRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `section_id` | `string` |  |
  | `assignment_id` | `string` |  |
  | `term_id` | `string` |  |
  | `sent` | `bool` |  |

  ## Response — `SubmitResponse`

  _Sin campos._

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
